<title>USA: TABLE - CHS Electronics Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CHS Electronics Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales	   $946,955   $316,506  $1,824,058   $619,501</p>
<p> Net earnings	   6,402	1,726	13,112	3,715</p>
<p>Net earnings per</p>
<p>common share</p>
<p> Primary		   0.41	 0.21	  0.85	 0.45</p>
<p> Fully diluted	   0.40	 0.19	  0.83	 0.42</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p> Primary	   15,594,818  8,696,343  15,468,952  8,277,012</p>
<p> Fully diluted   16,066,423  9,277,348  15,744,928  8,743,899</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  CHS Electronics Inc said these results do not reflect CHS's public offering, completed last week, of 13 million shares of common stock.</p>
